    {
      "id": "9b6c475f-cbeb-456f-bf18-35354524f90c",
      "title": "Compare as linhas e observe qual pergunta combina com cada resposta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "135e0f05-b233-4eac-8fd3-a9b1d3cc5849",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Soy de Chile.</strong> responde <strong>¿De dónde eres?</strong></p><p><strong>Vivo en Sevilla.</strong> responde <strong>¿Dónde vives?</strong></p><p>Veja outro par:</p><ul><li><strong>Soy de México.</strong></li><li><strong>Vivo en Quito.</strong></li></ul><p>A primeira linha fala da origem. A segunda fala do lugar onde a pessoa mora agora.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8971d17f-fced-4bad-bc77-139985187a29",
      "title": "Conversa de primeiro contato",
      "description": "<p>Duas pessoas se conhecem em um encontro informal e trocam informações básicas sem sair do repertório do capítulo.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Hola. Soy Diego.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Oi. Sou Diego.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bb5fdb8d810d40e4bce912821715432b_b05-d01-hola-soy-diego.mp3?Expires=1794099406&Signature=OpP7Fgnrqx2np12fETkJFfaudcef~cT67mQ3Q8pDp-iV8cLP4jXAgx9n9sZbc8IkhhryVFGceI44UQahzuw3CdTNCqXFdn7dNMMURGtSlELNxhyPriyaFeujl8SHe2T8OzHhwPjmOiXl3I2j81ViQoB8gPHkKj8D7MyRbshz15Z0k45fPhvQ6jL3FTcrvk0WlyCqyxm-wF6HVS9HfAh9pAjK0R-3m5Uoe99TP2t6SKTDjK6FcZotTajMPA-0znf7ssUrJdz82WLszn2vKgEIGNXZ6c10IqiMySk~4uglEHEBuoiFW4LRxgNBC0-vZG~SSGNedqlO1VaKdWxpSFpoZA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Hola, Diego. Soy Clara. ¿De dónde eres?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Oi, Diego. Sou Clara. De onde você é?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dbd6ba09017045b99d6ab87bc62bd75b_b05-d02-hola-diego-soy-clara-de-donde-eres.mp3?Expires=1794099406&Signature=shOVDjTHZn19MNpD4Oxi3E~b7jXjtWS6rtLu77kYp4ttcTkrJEZian7cQdYieXsyTMuAz0j3dxKmz~xD4rOBDh5f7fub69EfSrb9gvZnaasZ2fec5qR3IlsTbertHOkaJ~0xByJ~0I81eQiO4HBKa9NOJKt6U4YxAFoqsOjR1FiOKl~nPVJPbwJua4HTNjixP7ii~cGS317qL6dmqSapwrP8qdJuhUoZats4-w0-VBbATbqfCJstTQ7deaFI5q4zKWI2UojzxEOs~~i8U2Tzom0Wo9ltrZG-VgnX4X091zfmkgYdhBktdJFtKyrCpzboabgRnHPho70nbPGbwrdiWg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Soy de Perú y vivo en Recife.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sou do Peru e moro em Recife.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0646e96db2984093b3e5750e51d2f64b_b05-d03-soy-de-peru-y-vivo-en-recife.mp3?Expires=1794099406&Signature=i2rXShgxGT2rgoPFl-sbymGI2gKnCLZVnwsSKTLkEia5fPY~6dBzmH2GYEHDeHAtultJLX4jkEmHx0sD~srQ0QneAPj3lLA0SO3JVb-YJW6FdLh2xpJmyE93BHc8JsrEMVnZQjIpambzCzH4M4~uhGBvp~qIOtBwvC4ksFn8eZMwKErVYtJTHAu7irMCypb8UPTOQ8zpudHvDfh~ENlLA2KIHDlRPUSxMLit7mwiHD4CFcbMFu53tFgYwt~8KMY3Z-B2H9o2a7sTZK0BIyggQz58ECNevfBSjXWq8-pwfryCzyrFdoZ-Oh~OC30Doq823Y4ws3ZC-WTZGkmxttj~sg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Yo soy de Brasil y vivo en Curitiba.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Eu sou do Brasil e moro em Curitiba.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1a04969532bb4bfda6dd4c01a331e5d0_b05-d04-yo-soy-de-brasil-y-vivo-en-curitiba.mp3?Expires=1794099406&Signature=FQBz73XqZP3TWBN7HXjr1DuCHIFHrt-IkcP3XPUefqq~z9uZqSGe5DLReJq2qQaDibf9CZQWCjf~edT0meu~6AYkEXtEwHCRuorNB2nmxVfV~wdXmac6xb8ZIU8MOeQUBZEBoPzruNVRpCcvBoG6ilOmG189Ll3LDo9VyS6j3~UnVxivgYCdRTRZrcv6KMmNiPW5OICXbyt0giN8MJavPyMaI8xPPnK26KZZvy2yr1LCPqGtn9Zd3uYT2L6GKR5P1dpIq0jp0F8J3bmz2EZzWfApI8nhGIPaPinWPsJPML~MF28JpRnF9Eh5pSK7scG3ShnWOQh4LstllOxg-xilfw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
